{
  "name": "Cost Centers",
  "description": "Every department or cost center with a budget this year: its division, budget owner, finance partner, annual budget, year-to-date budget and actual, full-year forecast, open purchase orders, the five measures behind its score, and the score itself.",
  "position": 0,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "rescore",
      "label": {
        "en": "Re-score this cost center from its latest measures",
        "zh-CN": "用最新指标给这个部门重新打分"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-budget` skill in this folder and follow it. For the cost center I name, read its five measures, compute the score and status by the skill’s rule, and update `score`, `status`, `scored-by`, `scored-on` and a one-sentence `summary`. Propose an action if it turned at risk and has none open.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-budget` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的部门，读它的五项指标，按 Skill 的规则算评分和状态，更新 `score`、`status`、`scored-by`、`scored-on` 和一句话的 `summary`。如果变成有风险且没有进行中的措施，提一条。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "owner-brief",
      "label": {
        "en": "Brief me before the budget review with this owner",
        "zh-CN": "和这个部门负责人开预算会之前给我讲讲"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-budget` skill in this folder and follow it. For the cost center I name, give a one-screen brief: annual budget, spend against the year-to-date budget, the full-year forecast and when it was last refreshed, open purchase orders, heads over plan, POs without a budget line, renewals waiting for a decision, the last five signals and who wrote them, open actions, and three questions to ask. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-budget` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的部门，给一屏简报：全年预算、实际对比年初至今预算、全年预测及最近更新时间、未付采购单、超编人数、无预算科目的采购单、待决定的续费、最近五条信号及写入者、进行中的措施，以及要问的三个问题。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
